{"version":1,"content":"<p>據報道，三星電子與蘋果即將籤署一份DRAM半導體長期供貨協議（LTA）。蘋果作為全球規模最大的消費電子企業，也是頭部科技大廠中唯一尚未與三星電子籤訂長期供貨協議的企業。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586776.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T08:30:51.703663+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":89,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:18:18+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T08:24:10.776494+00:00","content_hash":"007d415633077fab29dec211add553c942e51afbe41ceee031e93892947ac00c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}